[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/709396005","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-709396005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":709396005,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwOTM5NjAwNQ==","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-15T15:16:34Z","updated_at":"2020-10-15T15:16:34Z","body":"@kuanghanqian \r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2020-10-15 11-07-47](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4222492/96148860-ae993b00-0ed6-11eb-82b3-cb10bd2eb01a.png)\r\n\r\nAs shown above, your gNB sent the SCTP ABORT in packet number 979. So, the connection is refused.\r\n\r\nWhen viewing the captured screen, it seems that gNB did it because the problem occurred before that. However, it is difficult to analyze all the reasons why gNB sent SCTP ABORT with your captured log information now.\r\n\r\nIf you provide log message and pcap from the point of starting Open5GS/gNB until the above problem occurs, I will analyze it.\r\n\r\nThank a lot!\r\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/709396005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/709865503","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-709865503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":709865503,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwOTg2NTUwMw==","user":{"login":"kuanghanqian","id":69032320,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDMyMzIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69032320?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian","html_url":"https://github.com/kuanghanqian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-16T07:06:58Z","updated_at":"2020-10-16T07:06:58Z","body":"HI, @acetcom,Thank you. I didn't have a problem today. Thank you. If there is a problem again, I'll trouble you again， Thanks a lot","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/709865503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/712589590","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-712589590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":712589590,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxMjU4OTU5MA==","user":{"login":"brchiu","id":6227912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjc5MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6227912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu","html_url":"https://github.com/brchiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brchiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-20T05:01:12Z","updated_at":"2020-10-20T05:01:12Z","body":"@acetcom & @kuanghanqian , based on my experience, one possible cause for receiving unexpected SCTP ABORT message is the conflict of kernel's sctp module loaded and the userspace sctp library used on the same machine. \r\n\r\nWhen kernel's sctp module receive an unexpected SCTP ACK from network driver which is triggered from userspace SCTP library and kernel itself is not aware of any SCTP connection establishing on-going, then it will respond ABORT message.\r\n\r\nPerhaps you might not use kernel sctp module directly, however, if you execute some other program, e.g. OAI-eNB, on the same machine before, then sctp module will be loaded.\r\n\r\nThat's why you might find the problem disappear after you reboot system because, at that time, sctp module is not loaded.\r\n\r\nFYI.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/712589590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/727180377","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-727180377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":727180377,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyNzE4MDM3Nw==","user":{"login":"kuanghanqian","id":69032320,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MDMyMzIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69032320?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian","html_url":"https://github.com/kuanghanqian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuanghanqian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-14T10:09:31Z","updated_at":"2020-11-14T10:09:31Z","body":"@acetcom @brchiu , Thanks a lot!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/727180377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/770473010","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-770473010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":770473010,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3MDQ3MzAxMA==","user":{"login":"kaposnick","id":16323584,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzIzNTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16323584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick","html_url":"https://github.com/kaposnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-31T23:40:49Z","updated_at":"2021-01-31T23:40:49Z","body":"Hi, I have deployed a single node kubernetes cluster with minikube. In this cluster, I am exposing the S1/AP interface (36412/SCTP), so that it gets consumed by the srsLTE eNB which runs on the same machine.\r\n\r\nAs you may see, the srsENB responds with an SCTP ABORT message.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16323584/106401647-87369180-6425-11eb-8499-74de91832ace.png)\r\n \r\nI have detected that, upon starting up the K8S cluster, the sctp module is automatically loaded. \r\n\r\nBased on previous answer by @brchiu : is this the module that intervenes and because of its unawareness of the SCTP on-going connection establishment, generates the ABORT message?\r\n\r\nThanks a lot! ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/770473010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/817439611","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-817439611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":817439611,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxNzQzOTYxMQ==","user":{"login":"ryanwwest","id":31378238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzc4MjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31378238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanwwest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-12T02:39:27Z","updated_at":"2021-04-12T03:05:47Z","body":"@kaposnick Have you been able to solve this and get past the SCTP ABORT message? I am having a similar problem as @kuanghanqian, trying to connect a UERANSIM gNodeB from a different machine to the AMF, but the AMF doesn't even recognize it. Here's its entire log:\r\n\r\n```\r\n04/11 18:46:34.540: [app] INFO: Configuration: '/etc/open5gs/amf.yaml' (../lib/app/ogs-init.c:129)\r\n04/11 18:46:34.540: [app] INFO: File Logging: '/var/log/open5gs/amf.log' (../lib/app/ogs-init.c:132)\r\n04/11 18:46:34.542: [sctp] INFO: AMF initialize...done (../src/amf/app.c:33)\r\n04/11 18:46:34.543: [sbi] INFO: nghttp2_server() [127.0.0.5]:7777 (../lib/sbi/nghttp2-server.c:145)\r\n04/11 18:46:34.545: [amf] INFO: ngap_server() [10.10.1.1]:38412 (../src/amf/ngap-sctp.c:53)\r\n04/11 18:46:34.546: [amf] INFO: [87de2c44-9b28-41eb-b7cb-a763d8702157] NF registred [Heartbeat:10s] (../src/amf/nf-sm.c:199)\r\n```\r\n\r\n`tcpdump` reveals the same INIT -> ABORT back and forth between the two machines:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31378238/114333784-28715080-9b17-11eb-981b-ea0569a088cd.png)\r\n\r\nI have found that the `sctp` kernel module is loaded but is in use by 28 things (I'm guessing these are the open5gs NFs). I can't figure out how to unload the module (stopping the system services just restarts them again). @brchiu, do you remember how you disabled it?\r\n\r\nThe AMF port 38412 appears to be open as well:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31378238/114334263-35427400-9b18-11eb-82ff-4f3be1ca1c44.png)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/817439611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/818018350","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-818018350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":818018350,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxODAxODM1MA==","user":{"login":"kaposnick","id":16323584,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzIzNTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16323584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick","html_url":"https://github.com/kaposnick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kaposnick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-12T18:08:45Z","updated_at":"2021-04-12T18:08:45Z","body":"@ryanwwest The eNB-s1ap bind address was mispropertly set (was set to 172.0.1.100 or something like this). It should be set to the out-interface address.\r\n\r\nReason:\r\nThe SCTP init message was sent to the AMF with source IP address = out-interface address. Upon response from AMF in the eNB, there was no SCTP socket open for out-interface address (the only one open was on 172.0.1.100). As a result, there was no socket to consume the packet and the kernel rejected the message.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/818018350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/818349151","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612#issuecomment-818349151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/612","id":818349151,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxODM0OTE1MQ==","user":{"login":"ryanwwest","id":31378238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzc4MjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31378238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanwwest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanwwest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-13T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2021-04-13T01:03:43Z","body":"@kaposnick Thanks, that helped! My issue turned out to be not specifying the interface my s1ap and ngap addresses were using. But your reply helped me determine that. I'll post what I had to do in amf.yaml here for others, though I did the same in mme.yaml:\r\n\r\n```\r\namf:                        \r\n    ngap:                  \r\n      - addr: 10.10.1.1    \r\n        dev: <custom interface>    \r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter getting a PDU connection and trying to get data, my UERANSIM is now complaining with a `TEID 6 not found on GTP-U Downlink` error so I've got something new to mess with probably via the UPF, but at least this problem is solved. Thanks again!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/818349151/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]